      <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted">
        Each adapter automatically strips framework-internal CSS classes and HTML attributes from captured output. Your AI agent sees clean, human-written markup.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-border bg-bg-muted">
              <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Adapter</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Stripped classes</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Stripped attributes</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-amber">Angular</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">ng-*, _ng*</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">_nghost-*, _ngcontent-*</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50 bg-bg-raised/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-amber">React</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">r-*</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">data-reactroot, data-reactid</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-amber">Vue</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">(none)</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">data-v-*</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50 bg-bg-raised/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-amber">Svelte</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">s-*, svelte-*</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">svelte-*</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-amber">Web Components</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">(pass-through)</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-text-faint">(pass-through)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-faint">
        Add custom filters via <code class="text-amber font-mono">classFilters</code> and
        <code class="text-amber font-mono">htmlCleaners</code> in options. A class is kept only if every
        <code class="text-amber font-mono">ClassFilter</code> returns <code class="text-amber font-mono">true</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
